{
  "description": "Normative billing arithmetic (lld/billing.md §11, `computeInvoiceTotals`, `periodBoundary`). Amounts are integer strings in the invoice currency (fiat minor units or asset base units). Tax per line: exclusive `round_half_up(amount × ppm / 10^6)`; inclusive `round_half_up(amount × ppm / (10^6 + Σppm))`; totals sum the rounded line taxes. Period boundaries are computed from the anchor with calendar months clamped to the month's last day.",
